OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds turn out for community
OL,4,Asport event
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of people have attended an
OL,7,Fevent to highlight local sporting
OL,8,Factivities and give residents the
OL,9,Fopportunity to discover and try new
OL,10,Fsports.
OL,12,FViva Slough, a social enterprise and
OL,13,Fcommunity interest company, put on a
OL,14,Ffree event that included judo, hockey,
OL,15,Fand karate.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
