OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds turn out for community
OL,4,Asport event
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrganiser Amandeep Mangat, who works
OL,7,Fwith public health teams in Slough,
OL,8,Fsaid the event helped raise awareness
OL,9,Fof local opportunities as "the
OL,10,Fstatistics are only getting worse,
OL,11,Fpeople are doing less and less activity
OL,12,Fevery day".
OL,14,FIt comes as data shows that life
OL,15,Fexpectancy in Slough is lower than
OL,16,Fnational and regional averages.
